<title>UK: Sainsbury sets 200 mln stg June 2002 bond. [CORRECTED 08:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Sainsbury sets 200 mln stg June 2002 bond. [CORRECTED 08:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   J. SAINSBURY PLC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    07.JUN.02</p>
<p>(Corrects amount from &quot;200 millino stg&quot; from &quot;$200 million&quot;)</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   S15.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+40 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED. S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT GILT DUE 2002</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
